gnosis\n-  Who are or have been treated by pharmacological or physiotherapy in the last 6 months\n-  Presenting allergies or alterations of the skin\n-  Not sign the informed consent document.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Federated boxers",\n              "Observation": [\n                "boxers"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "boxers"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "with lumbar injury",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "lumbar"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "with medical diagnosis",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "medical"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Who are or have been treated by pharmacological",\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "are",\n                            "have been"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "treated"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "are"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "pharmacological"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "have been"