istory of bronchotomy, bone marrow trasplanation, or cord blood transplanation.\n-  Known hypersensitivity reactions to any of the components of the invetigational product\n-  Prior or planned administration of other investigational products within 30 days before treatment with the investigational product in this study or duirng this study.\n-  Unable to perform 6-MWT.\n-  Female\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Prior treatment with iduronate-2-sulfatase ERT",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "ERT",\n                        "treatment"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "Prior"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "Prior"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "iduronate-2-sulfatase"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug-Name": [\n                        "iduronate-2-sulfatase"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- History of bronchotomy, bone marrow trasplanation,",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "bronchotomy",\n                            "bone marrow trasplanation"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "bronchotomy",\n                            "bone marrow trasplanation"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "History"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n