y taking spironolactone for a diagnosis of acne vulgaris\nOR\nFemale subjects between 18 and 65 years of age currently taking oral antibiotics for a diagnosis of acne vulgaris\nAND Subjects able to complete an online survey in English\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "Female subjects between 18 and 65 years of age currently taking spironolactone for a diagnosis of acne vulgaris",\n          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n            "Female"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "between 18 and 65 years"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "18",\n            "65",\n            "6"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "between",\n            "and"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "currently taking"\n          ],\n          "Drug": [\n            "spironolactone"\n          ],\n          "Drug-Name": [\n            "spironolactone"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "acne vulgaris"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "acne vulgaris"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "taking"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "OR"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "Female subjects between 18 and 65 years of age currently taking oral antibiotics for a diagnosis of acne vulgaris",\n      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n        "Female"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "between 18 and 65 years"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "18",\n        "65",\n        "6"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "between",\n        "and"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "currently taking"\n      ],\n      "Drug": [\n        "oral antibiotics"\n      ],\n      "Drug-Name