articipants must have the capacity and ability to give informed consent.\n-  Participants have been given an assessment and received a diagnosis of OCD.\n-  Participants must speak English.\n-  Participants must be able to physically attend treatment.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Participants must be adults 18 years or older.",\n                  "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                    "adults"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "18 years or older"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "18"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "years"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "or older"\n                  ],\n                  "Age": [\n                    "older"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Participants must have the capacity and ability to give informed consent."\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Participants have been given an assessment",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "assessment"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "assessment"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "and received a diagnosis of OCD.",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "OCD"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "OCD"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text"